<!-- ======================================================
					   Default
======================================================= -->
<Description>
    <Header>
        <h1 id="blazor-toolkit-textbox-component">Blazor Toolkit TextBox Component</h1>
    </Header>
    <Content>
        <p>The <code><a href="https://help.syncfusion.com/cr/blazor-toolkit/Syncfusion.Blazor.Toolkit.Inputs.SfTextBox.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">TextBox</a></code> component is a single-line input element that allows users to enter, edit, and display text values. It provides various customization options including floating labels, clear button, and input validation. For multi-line text input, use the dedicated <code><a href="https://help.syncfusion.com/cr/blazor-toolkit/Syncfusion.Blazor.Toolkit.Inputs.SfTextArea.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">SfTextArea</a></code> component.</p>
        <p>Add the TextBox component in the application as shown in the below code example.</p>
    </Content>
</Description>

